{
 "format": 1,
 "version": "1.17.0",
 "min_shell": 1,
 "notes": [
  "Today shows your days in a row you can swipe through, this week and the next two, and under the quick actions each day's to-dos, reminders, tests and renewals. Tap the Wefty logo to get back to Today.",
  "Quick actions sit at the top of Today now: New note and Note-taker big, Dictate and Flash cards under them.",
  "Drag to organise: drag folders up, down and into each other, and drag notes onto a folder, Pinned, Archive or the Trash. On a phone, hold first and then drag, or use \u22ef > Arrange folders.",
  "Flash cards made with AI: from a note's \u22ef menu, a folder's options, or a test that has no cards yet. You see the cards first and pick which to add. It's free with Gemini.",
  "Export notes as a text or Markdown file from a note's \u22ef menu, from Select notes (several go in one ZIP with their pictures) or from a folder's options. Copy as text copies the words without the marks.",
  "The note-taker keeps listening while you switch tabs in Wefty, and on a Chromebook even in another browser tab. On a phone, keep Wefty open while it listens.",
  "Chat can now do things in Wefty for you: send a picture of a subscription and say \"add this to subscriptions\", or ask it to make a note, add flash cards or set a due date. Each change shows under the answer with Open and Undo.",
  "Repeating reminders: \"Badminton every Tuesday 6pm\", every day, every weekday, every other Friday, every month. Ticking it done (or the time passing) sets the next one, and Chat can set them too."
 ],
 "build": "1.17.0-8b663f835324",
